===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*sebun}}, from {{der|ang|ine-pro|*septḿ̥}}. Cognate with {{cog|osx|siƀun}}, {{cog|goh|sibun}}, {{cog|non|sjau}}, [[w:Gothic language|Gothic]] ''[[𐍃𐌹𐌱𐌿𐌽|sibun]]''. Extra-Germanic cognates include {{cog|la|septem}}, {{w|Ancient Greek}} ''[[ἑπτά|heptá]]'', {{w|Old Church Slavonic}} ''[[сєдмь|sedmi]]'', {{w|Sanskrit}} ''[[सप्तन्|saptán]]'', {{cog|sga|secht}}.

